      }
    ],
    "status": "present",
    "value": "Grants have unique ids and are valid on the closed window [startTime, endTime]. Events may arrive in any timestamp order; every query reflects all events received so far. revokeCredit(id, t) returns false if the id has not been added yet or was already revoked; otherwise it records that the grant stops counting from time t onward and returns true. getBalance(t) is the sum of amounts of grants with startTime <= t <= endTime that are not revoked at a time <= t."
  },
